    "documentationMarkdown": "# 批量开关接受贴花\n\n> 批量切换 Receives Decals；可同时改源蓝图\n\n## 快速开始\n1. 重新打开 UE Python 工具集\n\n## 文件清单\n\n| 文件 | 用途 | 存放路径 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| `tool.py` | python | `Python/UEPythonToolkit/Modules/batch_toggle_receives_decals/tool.py` |\n| `module.json` | metadata | `Python/UEPythonToolkit/Modules/batch_toggle_receives_decals/module.json` |\n\n## 架构简述\n\n- 工具名称：`UEPTModulea7e3c3d7`\n- 挂载点：`OnToolbar`\n- 核心 API：未声明\n- 核心控件 Aka：未声明\n\n## MenuConfig\n\n```json menuconfig path=MenuConfig.snippet.json\n@file:assets/MenuConfig.snippet.json\n```\n\n## Controller\n\n```python controller path=UEPythonToolkit/Modules/batch_toggle_receives_decals/tool.py\n@file:UEPythonToolkit/Modules/batch_toggle_receives_decals/tool.py\n```\n\n## View\n\n```json chameleon-ui path=UEPythonToolkit/Modules/batch_toggle_receives_decals/module.json\n@file:UEPythonToolkit/Modules/batch_toggle_receives_decals/module.json\n```\n\n## 使用说明\n\n1. 批量切换 Receives Decals；可同时改源蓝图\n\n## 注意事项\n\n- 该模块会修改编辑器状态或资产。\n\n## Agent 安装指令\n\nAgent 应以 v2 package manifest 为安装事实源，先验证 ZIP SHA256、manifest、文件 hash 和 MenuConfig 合并预览，再执行写入。",
